    "## Overview \n",
    "The script answers one research question: \n",
    "how much labeled data does a YOLO model need to reliably detect a moving baseball? \n",
    "It does this by building a clean dataset from scratch, \n",
    "then training the same model repeatedly on different-sized slices of that data and comparing detection quality across runs."
   ]
  },
